            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Discs 4.4

- Enter album details manually, then find artwork with MusicBrainz and Cover Art Archive.
- Search for an album’s tracklist and import its tracks into editable single-disc or multi-disc sections.
- Search lyrics by song in Edit CD, with a more responsive collection search.
- Build and use a shuffle queue more clearly, edit the active CD from Now Playing, and see improved dark-mode contrast.
- Find related search suggestions in Listen History and Now Playing.
]]></description>
