            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in Discs 3.6.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Search CD editions by artist, title, or barcode and review imported artwork, genre, release date, and tracklist.</li>
<li>Search lyrics in your collection or online, with more precise matches and album artwork.</li>
<li>Add missing lyrics directly from CD details or Now Playing.</li>
<li>Open CD search with Command-Shift-N.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
